MODULE: ResolvedDeliveryLost
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: Neither the late original duplicates nor the reused new-log transaction arrive
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ heads' = [l \in Logs |-> IF l = 1 THEN 4 ELSE IF candidate = 2 THEN 2 ELSE 0]
--- REPLACE
    /\ heads' = heads
--- END
